WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Fallout Shelter in Cellar. Press Play.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Preparing the bottle: checking everything this game needs is in place.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Opening Steam: Steam starts in the background, with no window. (About 30 seconds of waiting cut here.)

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Starting Fallout Shelter: the game itself, under its own name.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Waiting for Fallout Shelter to appear.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.300
Playing. Fallout Shelter runs in its own window, named in the Dock.
